```

The PowerShell launcher automates the laboratory setup.

It performs checks for:

```text
Administrator privileges
        |
        v
Python
        |
        v
Npcap
        |
        v
Scapy
        |
        v
Required Lab Files
        |
        v
Receiver
        |
        v
Sender
```

The launcher can detect Python installations using common commands such as:

```text
python
py
python3
```

It also checks whether Npcap and Scapy are available before starting the laboratory.

