# Wireshark Setup

For the default local configuration, capture traffic using the Npcap loopback interface.

Depending on the installed Npcap version, the interface may appear as:

```text
Adapter for loopback traffic capture
```

The receiver also reports the detected loopback interface when it starts.

Start Wireshark before running the sender so the generated traffic can be captured.

