# One-Command Setup

If you have already reviewed and trust the repository, you can download the project and launch it using PowerShell.

Run PowerShell as Administrator:

```powershell
$u="https://github.com/mohammad-darvish-pixel/ICMP-Tunnel-Lab/archive/refs/heads/main.zip";$d="$env:TEMP\icmp-tunnel-lab";Remove-Item $d -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue;New-Item -ItemType Directory $d|Out-Null;Invoke-WebRequest $u -OutFile "$d\lab.zip";Expand-Archive "$d\lab.zip" $d -Force;$p=Get-ChildItem $d -Directory|Select-Object -First 1;Set-Location $p.FullName;powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\launcher.ps1
```

### Security Warning

This command:

1. Downloads code from GitHub.
2. Extracts the repository.
3. Executes `launcher.ps1`.
4. May perform installation/setup operations.
5. Requires elevated privileges for the laboratory.

Therefore, **review the repository before using the one-line command**, especially when running it with Administrator privileges.

Repository:

https://github.com/mohammad-darvish-pixel/ICMP-Tunnel-Lab

